Website features
1. hosts all companies policies in one location
2. easy for users to navigate to and view policies and see if they are up to date
3. policy renewal feature allows company to confirm users are re-reading policies as per the renewal timeline
4. Ongoing logging of users reading policies along with date/time - inline with ISO27001 audits
5. automated policy check for company. Managers don't have to ask or assume users have read the policy


Website design
  (Working)
1. hosted on Linux server with python and server.py script always running
2. server.py script scans 'policies-folder' for any .pdf/.doc/.docx files and if found, displays them on the website
3. When user logs in, the filereads.csv file is scanned to confirm they have read the policy, if they haven't, the 'Read Policy' button is active.

   (Not Working)
  3.1 If they have read it, it scans the date/time when it was read and compares this to the policyrenewal.csv file. If the date/time is longer then the policy renewal date then the 'Read Policy' button is displayed for the user.
4. Date and time recording is currently UTC time instead of server/PC time (which is set to BNE time)


